# Base URL of the DMC backend API (without a trailing slash).
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to client code.
#
#   Development (local FastAPI server):
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
#
#   Staging / production: point this at the deployed API host, e.g.
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.asianstartravel.vn
#
# If the frontend is served from the same origin behind a reverse proxy that
# forwards /api to the backend, use VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
# plus the proxy config — but never hardcode a host in application code.
